    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "TOM MAHER & COMPANY  SCSI IRICS IPAV - This is an exceptional opportunity to acquire a purpose built 4-bed end of terrace home with LARGE REAR GARDEN ideal for a wide range of usage. The bright, spacious, light-filled property is exceptionally well maintained, tastefully appointed is  presented in walk- in condition,  ready for immediate occupation with the added bonus of NO ONWARD CHAIN. The ideal choice for first-time buyers, perfect for families trading up as well as investors as MARKET RENT is achievable. Quietly nestled in a quiet cul de sac setting off the Kiltiper road a very popular and well-located development at the foothills of the Dublin Mountains. Deerpark is within easy reach of all local amenities to include shopping and recreational facilities, schools, excellent transport links, local road networks within easy access to the M50 Motorway , the Luas at the Square etc., EARLY VIEWING IS HIGHLY ADVISED TO AVOID DISAPPOINTMENT."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hallway with wood flooring. \r\nGuest w.c., pedestal whb window providing natural daylight and ventilation\r\nLounge : 4.60m x 3.41m feature Marble fireplace, piped for gas, wood surround, double-doors lead to the dining area.\r\nKitchen/ dining room/ 2nd reception:   A wonderful family room 6.90m x 5.36m Superb selection of Cream high gloss units and presses, tiled splash area, tiled flooring, divider counter, raised breakfast bar area. \r\n2nd reception area with tiled flooring, French doors lead to the rear garden.\r\nUPSTAIRS\r\nBathroom : 1.83m x 2.27m Bath - pedestal whb - wc - Tiled splash areas and flooring\r\nBedroom 1 : 3.01m x 4.46m wall to wall built in wardrobes plus overhead storage, T & G wood flooring. En-suite: 2.32m x 1.55m tiled shower cubicle, pedestal whb, wc, tiled flooring.\r\nHot press\r\nBedroom 2 : 2.72m x 3.60m built in wardrobes, T & G wood flooring\r\nBedroom 3 : 2.41m x 2.59m built in wardrobe, T & G wood flooring\r\nStaircase to landing with Attic storage \r\nAttic room : 5.81m x 4.02m En-suite : .81m x 2.79m Tiled shower cubicle - pedestal whb - wc - x2 Velux windows, eaves access and storage"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Hardwood double glazed windows throughout \r\nGas central heating\r\nTrip switch fuse board\r\nGuest wc\r\nCream high gloss kitchen units and presses\r\nx2 En-suites\r\nAll 4 bedroms have built in wardrobes\r\nWalled garden to the rear, large slate patio area ideal for relaxing or entertaining, grassy area perfect for budding footbalers or play area, space to the side with concrete bases, ideal for a wide range of usage."
      },
